1
00:00:00,353 --> 00:00:02,523
Would you stop it!

2
00:00:05,792 --> 00:00:06,892
(Howard:)Now, listen to me.

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:09,440
(Howard:)There's a welcome party
for incoming post-docs tonight.

4
00:00:09,596 --> 00:00:14,136
(Howard:)Go to it and meet someone
who isn't made of grease or pie.

5
00:00:14,301 --> 00:00:17,411
(Raj:)You think you're so cool
because your wife is a person?

6
00:00:21,141 --> 00:00:24,091
(Howard:)Look, Bernie's at a neuroscience
conference with Amy.

7
00:00:24,244 --> 00:00:26,054
(Howard:)-I'll go with you.
-You would do that for me?

8
00:00:26,213 --> 00:00:28,623
(Howard:)Of course. You're my friend.
I want you to be happy.

9
00:00:28,782 --> 00:00:29,822
(Raj:)Thanks.

10
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:33,220
(Raj:)Oh, Sheldon, since Amy's out of town,
would you like to join us?

11
00:00:33,453 --> 00:00:35,403
(Sheldon:)I want you to be happy, too,

12
00:00:35,555 --> 00:00:38,055
(Sheldon:)but not enough
to do anything about it.

13
00:00:41,094 --> 00:00:46,404
(Bernadette(on phone):)Howie, stop. I can't talk like that.
Amy's right here.

14
00:00:46,566 --> 00:00:51,136
(Amy(on phone):)Sheldon, stop. For the last time,
I will not bring home bed bugs.

15
00:00:51,905 --> 00:00:54,905
(Bernadette:)The hotel's nice.
There's a pool, a gym,

16
00:00:55,075 --> 00:00:56,285
(Bernadette:)the bar looks like fun.

17
00:00:56,443 --> 00:01:00,123
(Amy:)Because I looked in the bed,
and there are no bugs.

